    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape Camp Stranded is a single player horror game set at night, in an abandoned campground. This is a game about a man who becomes stranded at a strange cabin site. The road he arrived on is unfinished ahead and has become blocked behind. He must search the cabin site and find a way out of this strange place. Your objective is to investigate your creepy surroundings and find a way out of the site.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains jump scares.</p>",
